    <string name="media_info_no_playback">Nothing is playing</string>
    <string name="settings_help_body">• Open the management address in a browser to add or manage M3U playlists\n• Up/Down: change channel (can be reversed in Settings)\n• Tap the left side of the screen: channel menu; right side: settings menu; OK: channel list\n• Info / Space: show or hide the EPG and signal info panel\n• Menu / F6: open Settings\n• \"Help &amp; about\" contains media info (player only), this help and About\n• Favorite key / F: add or remove the current channel from favorites; long-press OK in the channel list to toggle the focused channel\n• The last watched channel plays automatically on startup\n• \"Show loading speed\" can be enabled in Settings\n• \"Switch stream\" lets you choose between multiple URLs of the same channel</string>
